<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday, slaughter steers and heifers $0.50 to 1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Choice 2-4 1150-1400 lbs 63.50-65.80, lot 3-4 63.00; few 1450 lbs 62.70-63.50. Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1300 lbs 62.00-63.50. Select 2-3 59.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1050-1225 lbs 62.00-64.90.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1000-1300 lbs 61.00-62.00.</p>
</text>
